1. Button Styles — tugma turlari
<button type="button" class="btn">Basic</button>

<button type="button" class="btn btn-default">Default</button>

<button type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Primary</button>

<button type="button" class="btn btn-success">Success</button>

<button type="button" class="btn btn-info">Info</button>

<button type="button" class="btn btn-warning">Warning</button>

<button type="button" class="btn btn-danger">Danger</button>

<button type="button" class="btn btn-link">Link</button>
.btn          → buttonning asosiy Bootstrap ko‘rinishi

.btn-default  → oddiy
.btn-primary  → asosiy
.btn-success  → muvaffaqiyat
.btn-info     → ma'lumot
.btn-warning  → ogohlantirish
.btn-danger   → xavf/xatolik
.btn-link     → link ko‘rinishidagi button
2. Button <a>, <button>, <input> bilan

Bootstrap button classlarini 3 xil elementga berish mumkin:
<a href="#" class="btn btn-info">Link Button</a>

<button type="button" class="btn btn-info">
    Button
</button>

<input type="button" class="btn btn-info" value="Input Button">

<input type="submit" class="btn btn-info" value="Submit Button">
href="#" nima?
# → hozircha haqiqiy sahifa yo‘q degani

href="https://example.com"
→ haqiqiy sahifaga olib boradi
3. Button Sizes — o‘lchamlari
<button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
    Large
</button>

<button class="btn btn-primary">
    Normal
</button>

<button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
    Small
</button>

<button class="btn btn-primary btn-xs">
    XSmall
</button>
.btn-lg → katta
.btn    → normal
.btn-sm → kichik
.btn-xs → juda kichik

4. Block Level Button

btn-block → button parentning butun kengligini egallaydi.
<button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">
    Button 1
</button>
5. Active / Disabled
Active
<button class="btn btn-primary active">
    Active Primary
</button>

.active → button bosilgandek ko‘rinadi.
